      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Pauling Apartments, Chicago’s first apartment building, were designed by Adler and Sullivan in 1886 on Astor Street.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
